@startuml CU-07
actor "Admin / Manager" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin productos)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /products" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ProductService / garment, variant, category, image" as Model

Adm -> UI : 1: registrar prenda
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /products
Ctrl -> Model : 3: create(db, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: GarmentRead (con variantes)
Ctrl --> UI : 5: 201
UI --> Adm : 6: prenda en el catálogo

Adm -> UI : 7: consultar prenda
UI -> Ctrl : 8: GET /products/{garment_id}
Ctrl -> Model : 9: get(db, garment_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: GarmentRead
Ctrl --> UI : 11: 200
UI --> Adm : 12: detalle de la prenda

Adm -> UI : 13: consultar variantes
UI -> Ctrl : 14: GET /products/{garment_id}/variants
Ctrl -> Model : 15: get(db, garment_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 16: variantes talla/color
Ctrl --> UI : 17: VariantRead[]
UI --> Adm : 18: variantes con SKU y precio

@enduml